event: turn
data: {"agent":"dsh","type":"thinking","text":"Let me synthesize the two answers.\n\nConsensus: both say the hardware one-key relay is the top priority — physical key directly triggers relay to another agent. Both prioritize hardware over further software work.\n\nDivergence: dsh specifies 阶段 2.1 using HID + global hotkey first, deferring BLE firmware; codex just says hardware one-key relay and emphasizes verifying context arrives correctly and result returns, doesn't specify HID-vs-BLE ordering or mention multi-key full mapping. Minor divergence: scope (dsh covers 8 keys/1 knob full mapping) vs codex scopes to single \"一键接力\" first. Also dsh gives sequencing (HID before firmware), codex silent on that.\n\nRecommendation: adopt dsh's approach — start with hardware one-key relay over HID/global hotkey before BLE; first step executable. Actually the common core: make the physical key relay. Recommend dsh's version because it's more concrete and de-risks. First executable step: bind S1/S2 to relay into dsh and codex via global hotkey (or HID), run an end-to-end test where the focus sentence reaches the next agent and returns.\n\nNeed to output three sections with headers, no retelling original text, no pleasantries. Keep concise.\n\n\"不要复述原文\" — don't paraphrase/quote at length. Summarize.\n\nLet me write."}

event: turn
data: {"agent":"dsh","type":"text","text":"## 共识\n两边都把优先级压在硬件侧，而不是继续打磨软件功能：核心动作是「选中一句 → 按实体键 → 交给另一个 Agent 接着做」，并把它作为第一件要落地的事。共同前提也一样——中台的接力/多 Agent 能力已经够用，真正缺的是脱离屏幕的触发方式。\n\n## 分歧\n分歧在首版的**范围与次序**：一方主张先做完整的 8 键 + 1 旋钮映射（切人、接力、复制、拉群），并明确先走 HID 键 + 全局监听、把固件 BLE 通道押后；另一方只提「一键接力」这一个动作，不提键位范围，也不提 HID 与固件的先后，但额外强调要验证上下文准确到达、结果正常返回。即：**全面铺开 vs 单点打通**，以及**是否显式规定实现路径**。\n\n## 建议\n采用「单点打通、路径先软后硬」的合并方案：首版只绑定 1–2 个键做硬件一键接力，用 HID 键 + 全局监听实现（不碰固件），把 8 键全映射和 BLE 结构化命令留到这一条链路验证通过之后。\n第一步可执行：把一个实体键映射到「把当前焦点句接力给 dsh/codex」，跑一次真实端到端——按下按键后焦点句进入下游 prompt、下游产出结果并回显到界面，同时在事件流里核对确认未携带全量历史。"}

